[b]CSS Astral Shared Assets, beta.11[/b]

Required for customized Faithful and Stray doubles in CSS v1.0.0-beta.11. Includes shared ghost materials and animation support. Outfit packages stay separate.

Close the game and extract into [b]MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/[/b]. Keep the older [b]CSS_SharedAssets_P[/b] package if installed; this download does not replace it.

NPC/enemy compatibility is partial. Unsupported appearances use the original Genessa double.
